Author: CelebiHunter contributors

Version:
    Major: 1
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 0

Targets:
    - 0x00172800

Title: CelebiHunter v1.1.0

Summary: Player-controlled Celebi RNG prediction for English Crystal VC

Description: |
  Finds shiny targets at the final GS Ball text and displays Advance, Target, predicted DVs and actual DVs.
  Start + Up toggles the HUD. L + R pauses, L steps, R resumes. Press A yourself at the target.
  Reads the real DIV and controls the encounter timing environment. Celebi is generated by Crystal's encounter routine.
  Tested on New 3DS at 268 MHz with Luma3DS 13.4.

Compatibility: Console
MemorySize: 5MiB
EventsSelfManaged: true
SwapNotNeeded: true
UsePrivateMemory: false
